<title>UK: Deutsche/UBS confirm ICI Eurobond mandate.</title>
<headline>Deutsche/UBS confirm ICI Eurobond mandate.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and UBS said on Friday they had been mandated by British chemicals giant Imperial Chemical Industries Plc to lead manage a benchmark dollar Eurobond.</p>
<p>The launch was expected early next week, market conditions permitting, the investment bank said.</p>
<p>No further details were made available.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
